{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（19日）上午10時16分，香港仔石排灣道100A號香港仔漁業及海事分署，發生工業意外。據報有吊臂撞落外牆，導致一男一女頭部受傷，其中男傷者半昏迷，女傷者清醒，同送瑪麗醫院治理。警方現調查事故。</p><p>經初步調查，男傷者姓歐62歲，女傷者則姓盧（譯音）57歲，二人均持有香港身份證。</p><figure><img alt=\"香港仔石排灣道100A號香港仔漁業及海事分署，發生工業意外。（黃偉民攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261029/1192434342673518592146237.jpeg/1t68mrijRTA5A14IMr1hu0cP3Lgk7DukPDE6nBYxOpw\"/><figcaption>香港仔石排灣道100A號香港仔漁業及海事分署，發生工業意外。（黃偉民攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"據報有吊臂撞落外牆，導致一男一女頭部受傷。（黃偉民攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261029/1192434339615739904204976.jpeg/Q6KPNdtWZ8JvUp33hrX9cPlp7zdWmWMxriiT3oQok94\"/><figcaption>據報有吊臂撞落外牆，導致一男一女頭部受傷。（黃偉民攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"據報有吊臂撞落外牆，導致一男一女頭部受傷。（黃偉民攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261029/1192434336457297920682074.jpeg/LXCt2WyfuMmD1LrG7yXw_ur4hzwqR9U9e57DfVGew30\"/><figcaption>據報有吊臂撞落外牆，導致一男一女頭部受傷。（黃偉民攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警員在場調查。（黃偉民攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261029/1192434927350583296306912.jpeg/X1ryfWViMvCTrnjPgX3tnbpb3qUHmqRCqqxkUYCsZFE\"/><figcaption>警員在場調查。（黃偉民攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"據報有吊臂撞落外牆，導致一男一女頭部受傷。（黃偉民攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261029/1192434330203328512725036.jpeg/93eLuy3dAwuCxd8L7CCnehvtogcAeFMz_2mzP9Vpsz8\"/><figcaption>據報有吊臂撞落外牆，導致一男一女頭部受傷。（黃偉民攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警員在場調查。（黃偉民攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261029/1192434930416750592782450.jpeg/my3DcNOdmLDaQXWBOFk2MR_vjYBMpUE-4C2Sicotkok\"/><figcaption>警員在場調查。（黃偉民攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"香港仔石排灣道100A號香港仔漁業及海事分署，發生工業意外。（黃偉民攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261029/1192434333286273024780629.jpeg/7rOF2XTeUM7fgj4BkLWp3PUmBDrq_qVZULHkgXqx5IE\"/><figcaption>香港仔石排灣道100A號香港仔漁業及海事分署，發生工業意外。（黃偉民攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"警員在場調查。（黃偉民攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261029/1192434933810073600539817.jpeg/73y28ET9ZrCfEsBU2R2PkpNuQZUfYjlPR-pJxG3qScQ\"/><figcaption>警員在場調查。（黃偉民攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"男傷者半昏迷，女傷者清醒，同送瑪麗醫院治理。（資料圖片）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260821/1167286386680664064560498.jpeg/GazwWAQ0cG-oUWj8oKG4irhQxMcwn61pFajvQRWo70E\"/><figcaption>男傷者半昏迷，女傷者清醒，同送瑪麗醫院治理。（資料圖片）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T03:22:02.019816+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":369,"images":9,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T02:48:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T03:18:31.770257+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T03:18:31.770257+00:00","content_hash":"a50844a2fe0ff81e170036aaafb8f33b4f628028c141d3b6b6f4a1d0031b6f73","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}